# StepForward needs NO secrets to run. It is a static site: every model runs in the browser.
#
# If you add an LLM "explain this draft" feature later, keep the key on the server side
# (a serverless function), never in src/ or site/. Put the value in your host's
# environment settings and in GitHub -> Settings -> Secrets, and keep THIS file as the template.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# Used only by the deploy job in .github/workflows/ci.yml (set them as GitHub repository secrets):
# NETLIFY_AUTH_TOKEN=
# NETLIFY_SITE_ID=
